 of Pugmire - and get it into stores. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3487_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3487\" data-vbnamecard=\"3487\">Jetstream</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar617_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"617\" data-vbnamecard=\"617\">Heavy Arms</a> - What's your thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>It depends. I don't know that I've ever seen an Onyx Path Kickstarter take this long to fund. We've got less than 20% to go, so that's promising. And worst case scenario, there'll be a lot of notices going out at 48 hours. However, I have seen Kickstarters fail because people start backing out near the end (which doesn't make sense, it doesn't charge you if it doesn't fund), and the end backers don't seem to think it's likely to fail... But I've never seen an Onyx Path Kickstarter do that.<br /> <br /> I think we've got it, but I don't think we're getting a bunch of Stretch Goals. The next few days will tell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-10T06:57:28-07:00","id":1317554,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1245406-pirates-of-pugmire?p=1317546#post1317546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It depends. I don't know that I've ever seen an Onyx Path Kickstarter take this long to fund. We've got less than 20% to go, so that's promising. And worst case scenario, there'll be a lot of notices going out at 48 hours. However, I have seen Kickstarters fail because people start backing out near the end (which doesn't make sense, it doesn't charge you if it doesn't fund), and the end backers don't seem to think it's likely to fail... But I've never seen an Onyx Path Kickstarter do that.<br /> <br /> I think we've got it, but I don't think we're getting a bunch of Stretch Goals. The next few days will tell.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's been one other, V20's Children of the Revolution, which didn't fund until the penultimate day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-13T21:27:52-07:00","id":1318402,"title":"","content":"We are at 36555$ now and 6 days to end of Kickstater. I'm worried a bit, but on the other hand - it's less than 10% now in last week. I'm a bit disappointed that <b>Mau</b>'s new adventure book and anthology are not special package for KS - <b>Adventures of Curios Cat</b> and <b>Tales of Excellent Cats</b>, respectively - but they are also really cheap as original on their own ( PDFs only cost 5$ on DriveThru! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ).<br /> <br /> <br /> We've got great spike in funding yesterday, with funding jumping 2605$ - I assume one of 'naming NPC in book' rewards was taken? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Maybe with other 'naming NPCs' rewards, we have shadow of hope for the one Stretch Goal? What do you think, guys?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.kicktraq.com/projects/200664283/pirates-of-pugmire-a-realms-of-pugmire-tabletop-rpg/#chart-daily\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/024/990/518/955d83d21eaef149e8cf72fd0f446b5f_original.jpeg?ixlib=rb-2.0.0&amp;crop=faces&amp;w=160&amp;h=90&amp;fit=crop&amp;v=1556808992&amp;auto=format&amp;frame=1&amp;q=92&amp;s=9ea02fce459fd6892efe40e1debd4086\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.kicktraq.com/projects/200664283/pirates-of-pugmire-a-realms-of-pugmire-tabletop-rpg/#chart-daily\" target=\"_blank\"> Pirates of Pugmire - A Realms of Pugmire Tabletop RPG </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.kicktraq.com/projects/200664283/pirates-of-pugmire-a-realms-of-pugmire-tabletop-rpg/#chart-daily\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.kicktraq.com/projects/200664283/pirates-of-pugmire-a-realms-of-pugmire-tabletop-rpg/#chart-daily </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Contribute to help us create a traditionally printed game book featuring pirates in the Realms of Pugmire - and get it into stores. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theony